<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the</p>
<p>$400,000 Kremlin Cup womens' tennis tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-1 7-5</p>
<p>Anna Kournikova (Russia) beat Elena Wagner (Germany) 6-0 6-4</p>
<p>Elena Makarova (Russia) beat Silvia Farina (Italy) 5-7 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Barbara Schett (Austria) beat Rita Grande (Italy) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Asa Carlsson (Sweden) beat Gala Leongarcia (Spain) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Sandra Dopfer (Austria) beat Sung-Hee Park (South Korea) 6-1</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
